{"title":"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems/Problem 4","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/4/414b21ece7188dddd7fcdfbf4eb61f61b1975767.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x_n)_{n\\geq 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"58\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/9/549c1cfefd0a31b4e009be51ff431d1e8866bc9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(y_n)_{n\\geq 0}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"56\" height=\"18\" />  be sequences of real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/624fdc3b96c258b9385887727c7b2c3815709b9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb6cba0b5147a2a7509e70b1613f7cf93ff36936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, and, for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />,\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/4/1c42c2eb43eee732142d0ce00d94594d1edf91fc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{n+1}+y_{n+1} = 2x_n + 2y_n,\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/7/227ff03360339f8aa8686718bc09680493a3c3d6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_{n+1}-y_{n+1}=3x_n-3y_n.\\]\" width=\"198\" height=\"16\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/7/2f7b2dab43c0867ce0904f5fda81948bd4211fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"16\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/a/e1af36d52144c78e912cb631699693cb6f184450.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_5 + y_5 = 2(x_4 + y_4)\\]\" width=\"158\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e819f20843e15edcce50b7a364853188a41789ca.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 2(2(x_3 + y_3))\\]\" width=\"119\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/f/4dfbfea301db4703b150234ea246ea2768e3c704.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 2(2(2(x_2 + y_2)))\\]\" width=\"142\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/9/899d7cf63d2d63ea7e7332602df8f0aaefff68d8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 2(2(2(2(x_1 + y_1))))\\]\" width=\"166\" height=\"18\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/c/b5cdadbd626ee2917335ca80d5da4ff5b2a183a1.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[= 2(2(2(2(2(x_0 + y_0))))).\\]\" width=\"194\" height=\"18\" /> Since we are given that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/4/624fdc3b96c258b9385887727c7b2c3815709b9c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_0 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/6/cb6cba0b5147a2a7509e70b1613f7cf93ff36936.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_0 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />, we can plug these values in to get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/8/9e85950cc8d251751ebbc97387ff2783cc65f4ba.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_5 + y_5 = 2(2(2(2(2(3 + 1))))) = 2(2(2(2(2(4))))) = 128 \\qquad (1).\\]\" width=\"481\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Similarly, we conclude that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/b/beb59d00e6e2fadd2b5feb5179e59dbb8e71c7a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x_5 - y_5 = 3(3(3(3(3(x_0 - y_0)))))= 3(3(3(3(3(3 - 1))))) = 3(3(3(3(3(2))))) = 486 \\qquad (2).\\]\" width=\"670\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Adding <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/2/f/62f62a19f0425d8e6121ca0c1cfd3ce96e43c9c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13e884265632b487384f748198c930a5b98cd5e3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 \\cdot x_5 = 614.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" /> Dividing both sides by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/2/86295aed3a7c5214d298b8bc2539d0b75b14d4b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_5 = \\boxed{307}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"88\" height=\"25\" />\n</p><p>~mahaler\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Add both equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/f/2cf2c1d009401a0386df94f534a1c43faaeb1b3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(x_{n+1})=5x_n-y_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"154\" height=\"20\" />, and subtract both equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/7/597727b835af2fb1ed3cfd50579afbec8b75b739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(y_{n+1})=5y_n-x_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"20\" />, so now we bash: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/0/0d026f477fbe6e34bc741348c75e483d5befc723.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1=7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"53\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/b/92b7d8b0846e425165869acf789e48993165e6df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"48\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/3/8f3dc6c199284859bd40ba66d8f5858cf4e101c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_2=17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392056e0d722bb29305e08a4c162f21c24c87b7c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_2=-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"62\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/f/41f6fe735b7250f2cf04ccd961198c33a0fb3f90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_3=43$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"62\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/3/ef3eadec7b7576222bbbff180f28a1afbff42ddb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_3=-11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/8/058d2b5a5f76acd2574e6a0d9a6db23ad75255b0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_4=113$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"71\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/e/f5e4269ce4b916929b94c897c664bfa8ba048cd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y_4=-49$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/3/f532da120bba9af25e285f1f705532258be4df58.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_5=\\frac{614}{2}=\\boxed{307}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~Geometry285\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ol><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Problems\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems\">Other 2021 JMPSC Invitationals Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_JMPSC_Invitationals_Answer_Key\" title=\"2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key\">2021 JMPSC Invitationals Answer Key</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=JMPSC_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"JMPSC Problems and Solutions\">All JMPSC Problems and Solutions</a></li></ol>\n<p>The problems on this page are copyrighted by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://jmpsc.org\">Junior Mathematicians' Problem Solving Competition</a>. <span class=\"mw-valign-middle\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:JMPSC.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/120px-JMPSC.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/a/ab/JMPSC.png/180px-JMPSC.png 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/a/ab/JMPSC.png 2x\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018015947\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.040 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 179/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 183/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 5995/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    5.111      1 Template:JMPSC_Notice\n100.00%    5.111      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21631:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018015947 and revision id 158145. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}